=== Spliced menus (indel hypothesis) — known-key grade ===
control    : P1030684 (published key), 120 letters
true shell : UKW B / Greek gamma / IV-III-VIII / rings AACU / pos VYAA
experiment : delete a 4-letter group at transmitted position 12,
             then attack the damaged transcript.

An indel is NOT a substitution. Every surviving letter is correct; they sit at
shifted positions, so each edge after the splice needs a different scrambler.
That is a menu-geometry change and it runs on the EXACT board — no tolerance,
no survivor inflation, nothing relaxed.

lost group : HBSX   recording is now 116 letters, transmitted was 120

crib       : VVVUUUVIRSOBENNULEINSXXMITU
             27 letters at transmitted offset 0 (straddles the gap at 12)

