SPECIFICITY — a wrong splice must NOT rescue the setting.
Three outcomes are tracked separately, because lumping them together is how this
test goes vacuous: a wrong splice that is ILLEGAL was never put on the board at all,
so counting it as 'rejected' would be claiming credit the board did not earn.

